fix:
Record each operation's duration (or each small batch's) into a percentile-capable histogram and report the distribution.
```rust
let mut hist = hdrhistogram::Histogram::<u64>::new(3)?;
for _ in 0..iters {
    let t = Instant::now();
    do_operation();
    hist.record(t.elapsed().as_nanos() as u64)?;
}
```
